---
description: Blender/GLB integration rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Use GLB assets only as visual shell. Runtime topology and interaction must remain code/data-driven.

Expected model path:
- public/models/runtime-core.glb

If the GLB file does not exist:
- use a procedural fallback RuntimeCore built with simple meshes
- do not break the build
- do not import missing files directly

When GLB exists:
- load via useGLTF("/models/runtime-core.glb")
- preload it
- keep fallback visible while loading

Expected Blender asset direction:
- low-poly runtime/server core
- dark metal body
- subtle emissive strips
- floating platform
- hologram ring
- not overly sci-fi
- not character-based
